mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: zakariaf-testing-strategy\ndescription: \"Enforces test doctrine where shape follows code not the pyramid: pushes logic into Flutter-free packages tested with pure package:test and an injected Clock; asserts invariants with seeded fuzz tests against an independent oracle plus round-trip and rounding goldens; prefers bare-implements fakes over mocktail for code you own; tests the data layer against a real NativeDatabase.memory Drift engine, never a mocked DAO; drives Notifiers headlessly with ProviderContainer overrides; guards one end-to-end acceptance gate and a runtime invariant tripwire; floors coverage on unrecoverable-bug files not a global percentage; and fixes the coverage-lies-upward gap. Use when writing tests under test/ or integration_test/, choosing unit vs widget vs integration, adding a fuzz or round-trip property, wiring a fake or ProviderContainer test, gating coverage, or triaging a flaky-suite failure.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: zakariaf/Flutter-Skills\n  upstream_skill: testing-strategy\n  upstream_commit: e073e5ea10c963d2c52ab1e423bd314c28a56154\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
